      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "409",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "标出点$A(4,3)$.作点$A$的关于$Ox$轴的对称点$B$.作点",
        "$A$的关于$Oy$轴的对称点$C$.$B$和$C$两点的坐标是几？测",
        "量线段$BC$的长度."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "410",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "作端点为$A(1,6)$和$B(4,3)$的线段$AB$.作一线段和线",
        "段$AB$对称：",
        "1) 关于$Ox$轴；2) 关于$Oy$轴；3) 关于原点."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "411",
